1Ch 5:1 , Judah and Joseph preferred before Reuben, who forfeited his birthright;
1Ch 5:3 , Ruben's descendants; some of whom vanquish the Hagarites;
1Ch 5:11 , The chief men of Gad, and their habitations;
1Ch 5:18 , Ruben, Gad, and half of Manasseh, obtain a victory over the Hagarites;
1Ch 5:23 , The habitations and chief men of that half of Manasseh;
1Ch 5:25 , The captivity of the two tribes and half, for their sins.
